```simple
step("Verify: calc_resolve honours operator precedence (2 + 3 * 4 == 14)")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val r = calc_resolve([2, 3, 4], [CALC_OP_ADD, CALC_OP_MUL])
expect(r.ok).to_be_true()
expect(r.pixels == 14).to_be_true()
```

</details>

